-| **`host_sck`** (`SPI_SCK`) | `Pin 17 (GPIO12)` | `U8_LS1` Bank 2 `Ch5` (`A5->B5`) | `3.3V -> 1.8V` | `3.3V -> 1.8V` (40MHz) | `Ball D1 (IOB_34A_SPI_SCK)` | FPGA 侧 `10 kΩ` 上拉至 `1V8_FPGA_IO` + `22 Ω` 串阻 |
-| **`host_cs_n`** (`SPI_SS_B`) | `Pin 15 (GPIO10)` | `U8_LS1` Bank 2 `Ch6` (`A6->B6`) | `3.3V -> 1.8V` | `3.3V -> 1.8V` | `Ball C1 (IOB_35B_SPI_SS)` | **FPGA 侧必须接 `10 kΩ` 下拉至 `GND`**（Target SPI 模式采样要求） |
